ysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533120/extras/4204943e4d2109833dfdf82161198dd7.poster.avif?t=1705924669\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533120/extras/4204943e4d2109833dfdf82161198dd7.webm?t=1705924669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533120/extras/4204943e4d2109833dfdf82161198dd7.mp4?t=1705924669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i><u>Peepo needs your help to reclaim his treasure. Mind your hops and aim for the top. Try not to fall too many times. Good luck!</u></i></strong>",
